for simplicity over complexity, and pattern over randomness. 1
                                                                                             Press, 1993.

Closure is strongest when elements approximate simple, recognizable patterns,
such as geometric forms , and are 1000ted near one another. When simple, recog·
                                                                                                                                                                                          Elements In text and graphics can be
nizable patterns are not easily perceived, designers can create closure through
                                                                                                                                                                                          minimized to allow viewers to partJci·
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                PtN GUIN
