Confirmation Is a technique used for critical actions, inputs, or commands. It provides      I   Also known as verification principie and
a means for verifying that an action or input is intentional and correct before it is            forCing function.
periormed. Confirmations are primarily used to prevent a class of errors ca lled slips,
