Safety Nets - device or process that minimizes the negative consequences of a              impending hazards.                       safety net, enabling the pilot and craft
catastrophic error or failure (e.g., pilot ejection seat in aircraft).                                                              to return sa fely to eartll .

Confirmation- verification of intent that is required before critical actions are
