tom right (e.g., con tact information). Though designs based directly or indirectly                                                                                                             lim-II     """
                                                                                                                                                                                                  ~.....! .1111
on the Gutenberg diagram are widespread, there is little empirical evidence that
it contributes to improved reading rates or comprehension.
